WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,530
uncle

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,860
What if someone on the boat doesn't agree with us and we would rather buy the boat?

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:07,660
You went there with so much money

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,860
Isn’t that leucorrhea?

5
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,170
Dad, why are you laughing?

6
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:14,810
Laughing at you, you are still young

7
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:15,890
Don't understand anything

8
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:17,690
Think about it yourself

9
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,290
If the shipyard does not agree to Uncle Sha’s purchase of the boat,

10
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:22,010
I'll make it clear on the phone

11
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:24,090
There's no need for us to make a special trip

12
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:27,500
So that's it

13
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,160
So they let us go now

14
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,320
Just pay with one hand

15
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,320
Delivered by one hand, right?

16
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:35,290
The boat owned by Lao Zhao's family

17
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:36,570
Is it only fifteen meters?

18
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:38,010
Whose family is Lao Zhao?

19
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:40,290
It’s your uncle Jianjun’s home, the ninth brother

20
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:43,170
His boat was the first tin boat in the village

21
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,570
It was because he bought the boat

22
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:46,970
The whole old Zhao family

23
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,290
When walking, you always look at people through your nostrils

24
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:50,250
Why have I never seen this Zhao Tiejun?

25
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:52,900
You have only returned to the village a few days ago

26
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:55,620
Zhao Tiejun sometimes becomes a boat when he goes to sea

27
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,180
It's normal if you can't see him
